.SS "\fBPort\fP clear (\fBColor\fP color = \fR\fBColor\fP(0, 0, 0, 0)\fP)"

.PP
Replace pixels inside the current clip with an exact color\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIcolor\fP Defaults to transparent black\&. Alpha replaces the previous alpha; this differs from drawing a translucent rectangle, which blends with existing pixels\&.
.RE
.PP
