.SS "\fBPort\fP setCameraDrawingEnabled (boolean enabled)"

.PP
Select world or screen coordinates for direct drawing\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIenabled\fP True to apply the port camera; false for screen-space drawing\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
This port for chaining\&. Coordinate conversions and layer camera selection are unchanged by this setting\&. 
.PP
.nf
const previous = port\&.getCameraDrawingEnabled();
port\&.setCameraDrawingEnabled(false);
try { port\&.drawRect(new pdg\&.Rect(10, 10, 30, 30), hudAttributes); }
finally { port\&.setCameraDrawingEnabled(previous); }

.fi
.PP
 
.RE
